&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build&lt;/strong&gt; scalable systems and data foundations for menu versioning, regionality, and customization that make a larger, more personalized assortment possible.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Leverage&lt;/strong&gt; AI and machine learning to automate menu and editorial workflows and sharpen assortment decisions, partnering with data science to take models from concept to production.&lt;/li&gt;
