&lt;p&gt;Good Chop is HelloFresh Group&#39;s premium meat and seafood subscription — American-sourced, direct-to-consumer, operating in a competitive market where the experience is the product. The premium positioning is intentional and the aesthetic bar is high.&lt;/p&gt;
